WHAT IS RESERVED OUTRIGHT

The game ships no image files: the factory, its five machines, the dough, the
cookies and the flames are all pixel sprites authored as string rows in
web/js/pixels.js and drawn onto a canvas. So most of what you can see here is
code, and the licence covers it.

The music is the exception, and it is the important one.

web/audio/ carries "makemecookies! x4." by Jimmi, a magmacrunch media record
label act -- the game is named after the song, not the other way round. Unlike
some of the other games here, the track is committed to this repository rather
than served from the website's jukebox, because the whole design depends on it:
a shift is one play of it, and the four RUSH windows are named for it.

Its presence in this repository is not a licence to it. The recording, the
composition and the master are Copyright 2026 magmacrunch media, all rights
reserved. The .ogg and the .mp3 are the same recording in two formats, and the
reservation covers both.

